00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:49.830
Mom...

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:56.800
Mom! Why do I have to buddy up
with a guy like him?

00:21:56.800 --> 00:22:01.510
I'd rather plunge into the ocean right
here than buddy up with Kimizuka.

00:22:01.510 --> 00:22:05.220
I'll hold on to your valuables for you.

00:22:05.220 --> 00:22:08.470
But I was supposed to be
Mom's top apprentice!

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:13.730
It's a one-time tactic, Char.
Come over here.

00:22:13.730 --> 00:22:16.020
Mom!

00:22:16.020 --> 00:22:18.070
That's my good girl.

00:22:22.030 --> 00:22:24.360
I'm really not jealous.

00:22:24.360 --> 00:22:28.040
If you two would get
along a little better,

00:22:28.040 --> 00:22:31.080
it would make things easier for me, too.

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:36.670
I'm still not happy with working
as a pair with Kimizuka.

00:22:36.670 --> 00:22:40.380
Listen... you two aren't perfect.

00:22:40.380 --> 00:22:43.010
For example, Sidekick, you're clever,

00:22:43.010 --> 00:22:45.840
but unfortunately, your physical
prowess rates below a water flea's.

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:48.930
You're not at all cut out for fighting.

00:22:48.930 --> 00:22:51.850
Is that so?

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:55.060
On the other hand, Char,
you certainly have fighting ability,

00:22:55.060 --> 00:22:58.110
but the reality is that you're
extremely dim-witted.

00:22:58.110 --> 00:22:59.820
What did you say?

00:23:01.900 --> 00:23:05.530
That's all the more reason that, for this
undertaking, I want the two of you

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:09.450
to surmount the challenge by compensating
for each other's weaknesses.

00:23:09.450 --> 00:23:12.790
But then we'll be leaving
you alone, Mom...

00:23:12.790 --> 00:23:14.710
It's troubling how much
you underestimate me.

00:23:14.710 --> 00:23:17.580
I'm ten times the fighter you are, Char,

00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:20.500
and I've got 100 times more
brainpower than Sidekick.

00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:23.760
There's no need to worry.

00:23:23.760 --> 00:23:27.510
My rating was unfairly low there.

00:23:29.810 --> 00:23:35.940
Do you hear? That's why the two of you
need to get along in the future--

00:23:35.940 --> 00:23:39.270
for the long haul.

00:23:39.270 --> 00:23:41.530
And on that very day...

00:23:41.530 --> 00:23:43.860
...the legendary detective died.

